<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 4</span>. </span><span id="S4.F4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">English vs. Arabic prompts (BLEU and CodeBLEU).</span></figcaption>
